# franz-go v1.16.1 pkg/kgo tests known to pass against the broker (run by
# run.sh when TESTS_ALLOW names this file).
#
# v1.16.1 is the newest franz-go released on or before Kafka 3.7.0, the
# version of the oldest Kafka CLI tools that CI tests. This list holds the
# tests of tests.allow that v1.16.1 has. TestGroupETL and TestTxnEtl stay
# excluded, for the gaps that FINDINGS.md records.
#
# TestPauseIssue489 and TestPauseIssueOct2023 are left out, although v1.16.1
# has them. tests.allow lists them because they pass at the pinned version,
# but at v1.16.1 they failed in 3 of 5 local runs and passed when run alone.
# franz-go v1.18.0 fixed pausing under PollRecords.
# client
TestMaxVersions
TestParseBrokerAddr
TestParseBrokerAddrErrors
TestUnknownGroupOffsetFetchPinned
TestProcessHooks
TestProcessHooksErrors

# compression
TestNewCompressor
TestCompressDecompress
Test_xerialDecode

# consumer
TestIssue325
TestIssue337
TestDirectPartitionPurge
TestIssue434
TestAddRemovePartitions
TestIssue523
TestIssue648

# group balancers
Test_stickyAdjustCooperative
TestNewConsumerBalancerIssue493

# producer
TestPromisedRecAppendTo
TestRecBatchAppendTo
TestMessageSetAppendTo

# record formatting / internals
TestRecordFormatter
TestRecordFormatterUnpack
TestRecordReader
TestRecordReaderJson
